<title>USA: Emulex says CFO McBride to resign end '96.</title>
<headline>Emulex says CFO McBride to resign end '96.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emulex Corp on Monday said Chief Financial Officer Chuck McBride is leaving the company at the end of calendar 1996 to become chief operating officer of privately-held Unplugged Communications Inc, a distributor of wireless equipment.</p>
<p>Michael Rockenbach has been promoted to vice president of finance and will be acting CFO while the company searches for a new chief financial officer, Emulex said in a statement.</p>
